#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libavif"
msgstr "Instalação do libavif"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libavif</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libavif</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:101
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_CODEC_AOM=SYSTEM     \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_BUILD_GDK_PIXBUF=ON  \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_LIBYUV=OFF           \\\n"
"      -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_CODEC_AOM=SYSTEM     \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_BUILD_GDK_PIXBUF=ON  \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_LIBYUV=OFF           \\\n"
"      -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the package (note that it will cause the building system to download"
" a copy of <ulink url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink>"
" and build the test suite with the copy), issue:"
msgstr ""
"Para testar o pacote (observe que isso fará com que o sistema de construção "
"baixe uma cópia do <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink> e construa a "
"suíte de teste com a cópia), emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cmake .. -D AVIF_GTEST=LOCAL -D AVIF_BUILD_TESTS=ON &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cmake .. -D AVIF_GTEST=LOCAL -D AVIF_BUILD_TESTS=ON &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:126
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The AV1 format needs to be added to the loaders cache. As the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"O formato AV1 precisa ser adicionado ao cache dos carregadores. Como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>gdk-pixbuf-query-loaders --update-cache</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>gdk-pixbuf-query-loaders --update-cache</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D AVIF_CODEC_AOM=SYSTEM</parameter>: This switch enables using "
"the AOM codec. This package is useless without at least one codec built in."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D AVIF_CODEC_AOM=ON</parameter>: Essa chave habilita usar o "
"codificador AOM. Esse pacote é inútil sem pelo menos um codificador "
"integrado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D AVIF_BUILD_GDK_PIXBUF=ON</parameter>: This switch builds the "
"AVIF loader for applications which use gdk-pixbuf. Remove it if you have not"
" installed <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"gdk-pixbuf\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D AVIF_BUILD_GDK_PIXBUF=ON</parameter>: Essa chave constrói o "
"carregador AVIF para aplicativos que usam gdk-pixbuf. Remova-a se você não "
"tiver instalado o <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"gdk-pixbuf\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D AVIF_LIBYUV=OFF</option>: Use this switch if you have not "
"installed <ulink "
"url=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/libyuv/libyuv/\">libyuv</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D AVIF_LIBYUV=OFF</option>: Use essa chave se você não tiver "
"instalado <ulink "
"url=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/libyuv/libyuv/\">libyuv</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D AVIF_CODEC_DAV1D=SYSTEM</option>: Use this switch if you have "
"installed <ulink "
"url=\"https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d\">libdav1d</ulink> and wish "
"to use it as a codec."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D AVIF_CODEC_DAV1D=SYSTEM</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado <ulink "
"url=\"https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d\">libdav1d</ulink> e desejar "
"usá-lo como um codificador."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D AVIF_CODEC_RAV1E=SYSTEM</option>: Use this switch if you have "
"installed <ulink url=\"https://github.com/xiph/rav1e\">rav1e</ulink> and "
"wish to use it as a codec."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D AVIF_CODEC_RAV1E=SYSTEM</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado <ulink url=\"https://github.com/xiph/rav1e\">rav1e</ulink> e "
"desejar usá-lo como um codificador."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D AVIF_CODEC_SVT=SYSTEM</option>: Use this switch if you have "
"installed <ulink url=\"https://gitlab.com/AOMediaCodec/SVT-AV1\">svt-"
"av1</ulink> and wish to use it as a codec."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D AVIF_CODEC_SVT=SYSTEM</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado <ulink url=\"https://gitlab.com/AOMediaCodec/SVT-AV1\">svt-"
"av1</ulink> e desejar usá-lo como um codificador."

